          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "User Intent Classification"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770957289979"
          },
          "code": "USER_INTENT_CLASSIFICATION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771320985397",
          "id": "1770956609087",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770956609089_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI agent within the \"Inventory Warehouse Operations Workspace\" agentic team, responsible for managing warehouse activities.\n\n---------------------\nInput Data\n---------------------\nChat History: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\nCurrent User Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nResponsibilities\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Understand the user's intent from the conversation.\n- Review the chat history and collect the interactions relevant to the current warehouse request.\n- Store the relevant interactions in the variable: filteredChatHistory.\n- Determine which sub-agent(s) are required to fulfill the request.\n- Forward the identified intent, along with filteredChatHistory, to the appropriate Agentic app advisor.\n- If required, invoke multiple agents in parallel.\n- If the request does not clearly match a specific agent, make a reasonable assumption and route to the most relevant agent.\n- Keep the response focused on warehouse operations and inventory-related workflows.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nAvailable Agents\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n1. Inventory Organization Chooser\n   Agent Code - INV_WH_OPS_ORG_CHOOSER\n   Description:\n   Assists users in selecting or changing the warehouse organization, since warehouses may have access to multiple organizations.\n\n2. Inbound Advisor\n   Agent Code - INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_ADVISOR\n   Description:\n   Handles all inbound-related warehouse activities, including:\n   - Searching for purchase orders expected to be received.\n   - Checking inbound shipment status.\n   - Reviewing ASN (Advance Shipment Notice) details.\n   - Tracking receipts and pending receiving activities.\n   - Any other inbound logistics or receiving-related queries.\n\n3. Outbound Processing Assistant\n   Agent Code - INV_WH_OPS_OUTBOUND_PROCESSING_ASSISTANT\n   Description:\n   Handles all demand-related queries, including:\n   - Finding pending demand for an item.\n   - Checking demand order status and customer details.\n   - Options to expedite a demand order.\n\n4. Item Quantity Monitor\n   Agent Code - INV_WH_OPS_ITEM_QUANTITY_MONITOR\n   Description:\n   Handles inventory quantity and lot-related monitoring activities, including:\n   - Querying expiring lots.\n   - Identifying soon-to-expire inventory by lot, subinventory, locator, or organization."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"agents\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"agentCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"filteredChatHistory\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Action Parser",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let input = $context.$app.$OraAction;\n\n// Parse the input only if it's a string (assumed to be JSON text)\nif (typeof input === \"string\") {\n  input = JSON.parse(input);\n}\n\nreturn input;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771321195278"
          },
          "code": "ACTION_PARSER",
          "id": "1771321034225",
          "inputs": [],
